<p dir="auto" data-start="6185" data-end="6207">То есть искомый вектор</p>
<span data-start="6209" data-end="6409" role="math" aria-label="\boxed{
(\omega_1,\omega_2,t_1,t_2,t_3,\beta)
=
\left(
\frac{2+s\sqrt3}{8},
\frac12,
\frac{1+3x+s\sqrt3(x+1)}2,
2+3x+s\sqrt3(x+1),
\frac{7+9x+3s\sqrt3(x+1)}2,
\frac{3(1+s\sqrt3)(x+1)}8
\right)
}" data-math-source="\boxed{
