<p dir="auto" data-start="2583" data-end="2590">То есть</p>
<span data-start="2592" data-end="2680" role="math" aria-label="\boxed{
\omega_1
=
\frac{
2x(t_1+1)-3t_1^2-4t_1-1
}{
8(t_1+1)(x-t_1)
}.
}
