<h1 data-section-id="notbvn" dir="auto" data-start="4725" data-end="4769">9. Но теперь <span data-start="4740" data-end="4752" role="math" aria-label="\omega_1" data-math-source="\omega_1" data-client-katex-layout=""><span class="katex"><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right:0.03588em;">ω</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.3011em;"><span style="top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight">1</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.15em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> уже будет другой</h1>
<p dir="auto" data-start="4771" data-end="4817">Вот здесь отличие от моего предыдущего ответа.</p>
